.Dd August 3, 2026
.Dt EARLY-BOOT.SH 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm early-boot.sh
.Nd preliminary filesystem mounts for microinit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Shell script executed by
.Xr microinit 8
before loading configuration.
Not hardcoded in Rust so boot policy can change without recompilation.
.Pp
Search order:
.Bl -enum
.It
.Pa /data/etc/microinit/early-boot.sh
.Pq if present ; under
.Ev BIGFRED_DATA_DIR
when set
.It
.Pa /etc/microinit/early-boot.sh
.It
Portable script embedded in the
.Nm microinit
binary
.Pq Pa scripts/early-boot.sh
.El
.Ss Responsibilities
The portable embedded script:
.Bl -enum
.It
Mount essential pseudo-filesystems if missing
.Pq Pa /proc , Pa /sys , Pa /dev , Pa /dev/pts , Pa /run , Pa /tmp
.It
Apply
.Pa /etc/fstab
via
.Ic mount -a
.Pq non-fatal if individual entries fail
.El
.Pp
Product images may install
.Pa /etc/microinit/early-boot.sh
with a distro-specific script
.Pq for example BigFred OS mounts Pa /data , seeds configs, bind-mounts Pa /etc/shadow
or an override under the data root; otherwise the embedded portable script runs.
.Ss Environment
.Bl -tag -width MICROINIT_INIT_LOGS_TTY
.It Ev BIGFRED_DATA_DIR
Persistent data root
.Pq absolute path ; same as BigFred
.It Ev DATA_DIR
Fallback data root when
.Ev BIGFRED_DATA_DIR
is unset
.It Ev MICROINIT_LOGS_TTY
Service logs TTY path from
.Nm microinit Cm init
.Pq default Pa /dev/tty2
.It Ev MICROINIT_INIT_LOGS_TTY
microinit operational logs TTY
.Pq default Pa /dev/tty3
.It Ev MICROINIT_CONSOLE
Console TTY path
.Pq default Pa /dev/tty1
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
Non-zero aborts
.Nm microinit
boot when early-boot is required.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr microinit 8 ,
.Xr fstab 5 ,
.Xr mount 8
